B.af_=new A.k7("We do not sell, trade, rent, or share Your personal data with third parties or advertisers. All downloaded files and local download history are stored strictly on Your Device and can be deleted at any time from the in-app Library tab, Your Device gallery/file manager, or by uninstalling YT Downloader.",null)
B.af0=new A.jr("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: QR Code Studio does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 100% On-Device QR Generation & Scanning: All QR codes You generate (including text, URLs, custom patterns, corner eye styles, and color palettes) and all QR codes You scan (via live camera or uploaded images) are processed 100% locally on Your Device. None of the text, links, or images You enter or scan are ever uploaded or transmitted to any external server.",null)
B.af1=new A.k7("If You have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact Us:\n\u2022 Developer: Sivaprasad NK\n\u2022 Email: sivaprasadnk123@gmail.com\n\u2022 Website: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader\n\u2022 Privacy Policy URL: https://sivaprasadnk.dev/yt-downloader/privacy-policy",null)
