B.af7=new A.k7("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: YT Downloader does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, browsing history, or GPS location) on developer-operated servers.\n\u2022 100% Local Processing: All URL parsing, stream extraction, audio/video muxing, thumbnail export, closed-caption (.vtt) generation, and file management occur 100% locally on Your Device.",null)
